# Alert 4 – Failed Storage Disk

## Alert

```text
Critical
Resource : DiskDrive-8
State : Failed
```

---

## Investigation

Verified storage health.
Reviewed RAID status.
Confirmed failed disk through the storage management interface.
Checked whether RAID rebuild was in progress.
Monitored storage performance throughout the rebuild.

---

## Root Cause

Physical disk failure within the RAID group.

---

## Resolution

* Raised a hardware replacement request.
* Scheduled replacement during the maintenance window.
* Monitored RAID rebuild progress.
* Verified storage health after replacement.

---

## Skills Demonstrated

* Storage Administration
* RAID Monitoring
* Hardware Incident Management

